Grammar

    0 $accept: programa $end

    1 programa: PLACA_LIGAR comandos PLACA_DESLIGAR

    2 comandos: comandos comando
    3         | %empty

    4 comando: TIPO_SENSOR IDENT '=' NUMBER ';'
    5        | TIPO_MEDIDA IDENT '=' expr ';'
    6        | IDENT '=' expr ';'
    7        | EXIBIR expr ';'

    8 expr: expr '+' expr
    9     | expr '-' expr
   10     | expr '*' expr
   11     | expr '/' expr
   12     | '(' expr ')'
   13     | '-' expr
   14     | NUMBER
   15     | IDENT


Terminals, with rules where they appear

    $end (0) 0
    '(' (40) 12
    ')' (41) 12
    '*' (42) 10
    '+' (43) 8
    '-' (45) 9 13
    '/' (47) 11
    ';' (59) 4 5 6 7
    '=' (61) 4 5 6
    error (256)
    PLACA_LIGAR (258) 1
    PLACA_DESLIGAR (259) 1
    TIPO_SENSOR (260) 4
    TIPO_MEDIDA (261) 5
    EXIBIR (262) 7
    NUMBER <valor> (263) 4 14
    IDENT <nome> (264) 4 5 6 15
    UMINUS (265)


Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

    $accept (19)
        on left: 0
    programa (20)
        on left: 1
        on right: 0
    comandos (21)
        on left: 2 3
        on right: 1 2
    comando (22)
        on left: 4 5 6 7
        on right: 2
    expr <valor> (23)
        on left: 8 9 10 11 12 13 14 15
        on right: 5 6 7 8 9 10 11 12 13


State 0

    0 $accept: . programa $end

    PLACA_LIGAR  shift, and go to state 1

    programa  go to state 2


State 1

    1 programa: PLACA_LIGAR . comandos PLACA_DESLIGAR

    $default  reduce using rule 3 (comandos)

    comandos  go to state 3


State 2

    0 $accept: programa . $end

    $end  shift, and go to state 4


State 3

    1 programa: PLACA_LIGAR comandos . PLACA_DESLIGAR
    2 comandos: comandos . comando

    PLACA_DESLIGAR  shift, and go to state 5
    TIPO_SENSOR     shift, and go to state 6
    TIPO_MEDIDA     shift, and go to state 7
    EXIBIR          shift, and go to state 8
    IDENT           shift, and go to state 9

    comando  go to state 10


State 4

    0 $accept: programa $end .

    $default  accept


State 5

    1 programa: PLACA_LIGAR comandos PLACA_DESLIGAR .

    $default  reduce using rule 1 (programa)


State 6

    4 comando: TIPO_SENSOR . IDENT '=' NUMBER ';'

    IDENT  shift, and go to state 11


State 7

    5 comando: TIPO_MEDIDA . IDENT '=' expr ';'

    IDENT  shift, and go to state 12


State 8

    7 comando: EXIBIR . expr ';'

    NUMBER  shift, and go to state 13
    IDENT   shift, and go to state 14
    '-'     shift, and go to state 15
    '('     shift, and go to state 16

    expr  go to state 17


State 9

    6 comando: IDENT . '=' expr ';'

    '='  shift, and go to state 18


State 10

    2 comandos: comandos comando .

    $default  reduce using rule 2 (comandos)


State 11

    4 comando: TIPO_SENSOR IDENT . '=' NUMBER ';'

    '='  shift, and go to state 19


State 12

    5 comando: TIPO_MEDIDA IDENT . '=' expr ';'

    '='  shift, and go to state 20


State 13

   14 expr: NUMBER .

    $default  reduce using rule 14 (expr)


State 14

   15 expr: IDENT .

    $default  reduce using rule 15 (expr)


State 15

   13 expr: '-' . expr

    NUMBER  shift, and go to state 13
    IDENT   shift, and go to state 14
    '-'     shift, and go to state 15
    '('     shift, and go to state 16

    expr  go to state 21


State 16

   12 expr: '(' . expr ')'

    NUMBER  shift, and go to state 13
    IDENT   shift, and go to state 14
    '-'     shift, and go to state 15
    '('     shift, and go to state 16

    expr  go to state 22


State 17

    7 comando: EXIBIR expr . ';'
    8 expr: expr . '+' expr
    9     | expr . '-' expr
   10     | expr . '*' expr
   11     | expr . '/' expr

    '+'  shift, and go to state 23
    '-'  shift, and go to state 24
    '*'  shift, and go to state 25
    '/'  shift, and go to state 26
    ';'  shift, and go to state 27


State 18

    6 comando: IDENT '=' . expr ';'

    NUMBER  shift, and go to state 13
    IDENT   shift, and go to state 14
    '-'     shift, and go to state 15
    '('     shift, and go to state 16

    expr  go to state 28


State 19

    4 comando: TIPO_SENSOR IDENT '=' . NUMBER ';'

    NUMBER  shift, and go to state 29


State 20

    5 comando: TIPO_MEDIDA IDENT '=' . expr ';'

    NUMBER  shift, and go to state 13
    IDENT   shift, and go to state 14
    '-'     shift, and go to state 15
    '('     shift, and go to state 16

    expr  go to state 30


State 21

    8 expr: expr . '+' expr
    9     | expr . '-' expr
   10     | expr . '*' expr
   11     | expr . '/' expr
   13     | '-' expr .

    $default  reduce using rule 13 (expr)


State 22

    8 expr: expr . '+' expr
    9     | expr . '-' expr
   10     | expr . '*' expr
   11     | expr . '/' expr
   12     | '(' expr . ')'

    '+'  shift, and go to state 23
    '-'  shift, and go to state 24
    '*'  shift, and go to state 25
    '/'  shift, and go to state 26
    ')'  shift, and go to state 31


State 23

    8 expr: expr '+' . expr

    NUMBER  shift, and go to state 13
    IDENT   shift, and go to state 14
    '-'     shift, and go to state 15
    '('     shift, and go to state 16

    expr  go to state 32


State 24

    9 expr: expr '-' . expr

    NUMBER  shift, and go to state 13
    IDENT   shift, and go to state 14
    '-'     shift, and go to state 15
    '('     shift, and go to state 16

    expr  go to state 33


State 25

   10 expr: expr '*' . expr

    NUMBER  shift, and go to state 13
    IDENT   shift, and go to state 14
    '-'     shift, and go to state 15
    '('     shift, and go to state 16

    expr  go to state 34


State 26

   11 expr: expr '/' . expr

    NUMBER  shift, and go to state 13
    IDENT   shift, and go to state 14
    '-'     shift, and go to state 15
    '('     shift, and go to state 16

    expr  go to state 35


State 27

    7 comando: EXIBIR expr ';' .

    $default  reduce using rule 7 (comando)


State 28

    6 comando: IDENT '=' expr . ';'
    8 expr: expr . '+' expr
    9     | expr . '-' expr
   10     | expr . '*' expr
   11     | expr . '/' expr

    '+'  shift, and go to state 23
    '-'  shift, and go to state 24
    '*'  shift, and go to state 25
    '/'  shift, and go to state 26
    ';'  shift, and go to state 36


State 29

    4 comando: TIPO_SENSOR IDENT '=' NUMBER . ';'

    ';'  shift, and go to state 37


State 30

    5 comando: TIPO_MEDIDA IDENT '=' expr . ';'
    8 expr: expr . '+' expr
    9     | expr . '-' expr
   10     | expr . '*' expr
   11     | expr . '/' expr

    '+'  shift, and go to state 23
    '-'  shift, and go to state 24
    '*'  shift, and go to state 25
    '/'  shift, and go to state 26
    ';'  shift, and go to state 38


State 31

   12 expr: '(' expr ')' .

    $default  reduce using rule 12 (expr)


State 32

    8 expr: expr . '+' expr
    8     | expr '+' expr .
    9     | expr . '-' expr
   10     | expr . '*' expr
   11     | expr . '/' expr

    '*'  shift, and go to state 25
    '/'  shift, and go to state 26

    $default  reduce using rule 8 (expr)


State 33

    8 expr: expr . '+' expr
    9     | expr . '-' expr
    9     | expr '-' expr .
   10     | expr . '*' expr
   11     | expr . '/' expr

    '*'  shift, and go to state 25
    '/'  shift, and go to state 26

    $default  reduce using rule 9 (expr)


State 34

    8 expr: expr . '+' expr
    9     | expr . '-' expr
   10     | expr . '*' expr
   10     | expr '*' expr .
   11     | expr . '/' expr

    $default  reduce using rule 10 (expr)


State 35

    8 expr: expr . '+' expr
    9     | expr . '-' expr
   10     | expr . '*' expr
   11     | expr . '/' expr
   11     | expr '/' expr .

    $default  reduce using rule 11 (expr)


State 36

    6 comando: IDENT '=' expr ';' .

    $default  reduce using rule 6 (comando)


State 37

    4 comando: TIPO_SENSOR IDENT '=' NUMBER ';' .

    $default  reduce using rule 4 (comando)


State 38

    5 comando: TIPO_MEDIDA IDENT '=' expr ';' .

    $default  reduce using rule 5 (comando)
